# Ferramentas MCP

Preferir MCP à web quando aplicável.

## next-devtools
Requer `npm run dev`. Erros/build → `get_errors`. Rotas e estrutura → `nextjs_index`. Docs Next.js → `nextjs_docs`. Server Actions → `get_server_action_by_id`.

## supabase
Docs/auth/SSR → `search_docs`. Banco → `list_tables`, `execute_sql`, `apply_migration`. Projetos → `list_projects`.

## shadcn
Componente UI → `search_items_in_registries` → `get_add_command_for_items`. Exemplos → `get_item_examples_from_registries`.

## Linear
Criar/atualizar issue → `save_issue` (template em `linear-task-template.mdc`). Listar/buscar → `list_issues`, `get_issue`. **Começar tarefa** → `start-issue.mdc` (get_issue, pull, branch, save_issue assignee+In Progress, push).

## Referência rápida
| Tarefa | MCP | Ferramenta |
|--------|-----|------------|
| Erros/build | next-devtools | get_errors |
| Docs Next.js | next-devtools | nextjs_docs |
| Estrutura app | next-devtools | nextjs_index |
| Auth/SSR Supabase | supabase | search_docs |
| Componente shadcn | shadcn | search_items_in_registries, get_add_command_for_items |
| Issue Linear | Linear | save_issue, get_issue, list_issues |
